# textdomain: doggiowars
# Catalan translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Aerial dogfight over floating voxel islands — you ARE the fighter plane. 12 island biomes, volcanoes and waterfalls, aerobatic tricks, destructible terrain and greyhound races after a golden rabbit. Keyboard + gamepad.=Combat aeri sobre illes vòxel flotants — ETS TU el caça. 12 biomes d'illes, volcans i cascades, acrobàcies aèries, terreny destructible i curses de llebrers darrere d'un conill daurat. Teclat + comandament.
